<title>USA: First Shenango Q1 Dec 31 net increases.</title>
<headline>First Shenango Q1 Dec 31 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW CASTLE, Pa. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.53		    $0.35</p>
<p> Net			  1,153			804</p>
<p>Provision for loan</p>
<p>    losses		    225			233</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,261		    2,297</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.33		    $1.34</p>
<p> Net			  3,010		    3,079</p>
<p>Provisions for loan</p>
<p>    losses		    899			918</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,257		    2,290</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for fiscal 1996 included a one time SAIF special assessment of $1,666,000. Excluding the SAIF assessment, net income would have been $4,040,000, or $1.79 per share.</p>
</text>
